<p><strong>Location:</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Minto+Recreation+Complex+-+Barrhaven/@45.2530126,-75.7370512,778m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x4ccdfcb5ae66eec7:0xac7dd64d5db35ea1!2s3500+Cambrian+Rd,+Nepean,+ON+K2J+0E9!3b1!8m2!3d45.2530126!4d-75.7344763!16s%2Fg%2F11c2570qdp!3m5!1s0x4ccdfcb5d204a48f:0x75cf6183628db0de!8m2!3d45.2528861!4d-75.7340638!16s%2Fg%2F11b6bv9x7y?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAyMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D">3500 Cambrian Drive</a><strong>&nbsp;</strong>(Traffic circle of Cambrian and Greenbank Roads)</p>
